# Integer128 addition overflow

Adds 1 to the int128 maximum to verify the overflow fails with a runtime
error instead of wrapping.

>>> source
maximum: int128 = 170141183460469231731687303715884105727
unit: int128 = 1

overflow: int128 = maximum + unit
print(overflow)

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: runtime error: integer overflow in addition

<<< exit
1
